            "faq_5_answer": "While some benefits like improved mood and energy can be noticed within 2-4 weeks, maximum benefits for cardiovascular health, joint support, and cognitive function typically develop over 2-3 months of consistent daily use.",
            "faq_6_question": "Are there any certifications for quality and safety?",
            "faq_6_answer": "Yes, AIWO Omega 3 is manufactured in GMP and ISO certified facilities. It is FSSAI approved, Halal certified, and gluten-free. Each batch is tested for purity, potency, and absence of heavy metals and toxins."
